{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"python3 -B -c 'import json,pathlib; d=json.loads(pathlib.Path(\\\"../../../poc/data/hybrid-2026-11-20/opening-census.json\\\").read_text());\nfor m in d:\n if m[\\\"matter\\\"] in {\\\"M07\\\",\\\"M12\\\",\\\"M19\\\",\\\"M20\\\",\\\"M27\\\",\\\"M31\\\"}:\n  print(m[\\\"matter\\\"],m[\\\"question\\\"],m[\\\"covered_by\\\"],[(k,v[\\\"linked\\\"]) for k,v in m[\\\"draws\\\"].items()] if m[\\\"matter\\\"]==\\\"M20\\\" else \\\"\\\")'; rg -n 'Will NVIDIA complete final agreements for the announced institutional AI-infrastructure financing platforms' ../../../poc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/reading-diagnostic/mapping-out/library-L6.json | cut -c1-360\"","aggregated_output":"M07 What will NVIDIA's data-center revenue be in FY2028? {'old-1': [], 'old-2': [], 'old-3': []} \nM12 What amount of NVIDIA's financial backstop for OpenAI's SB Energy Ohio data-center lease remains outstanding at FY2027 year-end? {'old-1': [], 'old-2': [], 'old-3': []} \nM19 Will NVIDIA complete its ~$12.9B acquisition of Hugging Face, including US/EU regulatory clearance, by 2027-06-30 (end of the company's H1 2027 close target)? {'old-1': [{'question': 'Q35', 'covers': True}, {'question': 'Q47', 'covers': True}], 'old-2': [], 'old-3': [{'question': 'Q39', 'covers': True}]} \nM20 Will NVIDIA sign residual-value support agreements (up to $125B) for the Goldman Sachs/Blackstone AI infrastructure partnerships by 2027-03-31 (researcher-set check date)? {'old-1': [], 'old-2': [], 'old-3': []} [('old-1', {'How much credit support for AI clouds will NVIDIA have committed at the end of FY2027?': 1, 'What gross margin will NVIDIA report for FY2027?': 1, \"Will NVIDIA agree to provide the reported financing guarantee for OpenAI's southern Ohio data center project by January 31, 2027?\": 1, 'What total amount of NVIDIA’s credit-support and capacity-purchase obligations will be outstanding at the FY2027 annual report?': 1, 'Will NVIDIA agree to provide a financing guarantee for OpenAI’s southern Ohio data center project by January 31, 2027?': 1, 'Will NVIDIA complete final agreements for the announced institutional AI-infrastructure financing platforms by August 15, 2027?': 1, \"What will NVIDIA's total revenue be in FY2027?\": 1, \"How much will NVIDIA's total revenue grow year over year in FY2028?\": 1}), ('old-2', {\"Will NVIDIA sign a financial guarantee for OpenAI's Ohio data-center lease by 2027-07-01?\": 2, 'How much credit support will NVIDIA have committed under its AI-cloud model by the publication of its FY2027 annual report?': 1, 'How much total revenue will NVIDIA report for FY2027?': 1, \"At NVIDIA's FY2027 annual report, how much will its commitments for customer and cloud-provider credit support, guarantees, and capacity backstops reach?\": 1, \"How much will NVIDIA's total revenue grow in FY2027?\": 1, 'What gross margin will NVIDIA report for FY2027?': 1}), ('old-3', {'Will NVIDIA sign an agreement to provide financial guarantees for OpenAI’s Ohio data-center lease by July 1, 2027?': 2, \"At NVIDIA's next annual filing, what amount of credit-support obligations under its AI-cloud model will NVIDIA have outstanding or committed?\": 1, 'What will NVIDIA report as total revenue for FY2027?': 1, 'What will NVIDIA report as total revenue for FY2028?': 1})]\nM27 How much of NVIDIA's agreed Hugging Face acquisition obligation remains outstanding at FY2027 year-end? {'old-1': [], 'old-2': [], 'old-3': []} \nM31 How much will NVIDIA report in guarantee obligations tied to AI cloud partners in its FY2027 annual report? {'old-1': [{'question': 'Q1', 'covers': True}, {'question': 'Q2', 'covers': 'split'}], 'old-2': [{'question': 'Q1', 'covers': True}, {'question': 'Q2', 'covers': True}], 'old-3': [{'question': 'Q1', 'covers': True}]} \n11864:  \"question\": \"Will NVIDIA complete final agreements for the announced institutional AI-infrastructure financing platforms by August 15, 2027?\",\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
